    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GigCrawler</strong> is a <i>co-op roguelite</i> where you and your crew take on deadly contracts in a world twisted by demonic forces and corporate greed. <br><i>Customize your build</i> before each mission with the <i>Soul Modder system</i>, unlocking <i>skills</i>, <i>weapons</i>, and <i>buffs</i> from fallen enemies. <br>Explore <i>procedurally generated dungeons</i> with your team, facing dynamic objectives, evolving threats, and high risk rewards.<br>There are no fixed classes, no random drops, and roles can be swapped at any time. Just you, your team, and the chaos ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/cf99cc5b6314b174188c8bccb0d92b62.poster.avif?t=1755509312\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/cf99cc5b6314b174188c8bccb0d92b62.webm?t=1755509312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/cf99cc5b6314b174188c8bccb0d92b62.mp4?t=1755509312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOUL MODDING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Because Who Needs a Stable Identity?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to some <i>totally safe</i> tech from <i>WardCorp</i>, every Freelancer can <i>swap abilities</i> by loading Mods into their Soul Modder. <i>Roguelite randomness</i>? Nah, you\u2019re in charge now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mods define your <i>playstyle</i>: unlock skills, buffs, or total chaos. Some are rare, and some are not: all of them are yours to test.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/37b7b65f19256ee10b126c7927690b91.poster.avif?t=1755509312\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/37b7b65f19256ee10b126c7927690b91.webm?t=1755509312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/37b7b65f19256ee10b126c7927690b91.mp4?t=1755509312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER &amp; INDIRECT COMPETITION</strong><br><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Because Misery Loves Company</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GigCrawler is best played in <i>co-op</i>, because suffering together is way more fun. Sure, you <i>can</i> go <i>solo</i>, but why would you when you can have teammates to blame? <br>Freelancer builds are flexible, and in co-op, that flexibility keeps you alive. <br>Translation: teamwork makes the dream work.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/0230ebfb3ccc9d0a142e5adc692764cb.poster.avif?t=1755509312\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/0230ebfb3ccc9d0a142e5adc692764cb.webm?t=1755509312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/0230ebfb3ccc9d0a142e5adc692764cb.mp4?t=1755509312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WEAPON SYSTEM &amp; CAREER DEVELOPMENT </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Climbing the Gig Ladder, One Dubious Weapon at a Time</i></strong><br>Just like real life, your career starts with absolute <i>randomness</i>. Each run throws a chaotic mix of weapons your way: sometimes you're lucky, sometimes you\u2019re stuck swinging a rusty spoon. But hey, that\u2019s the freelancer grind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons come in all shapes and <i>archetypes</i>, with a <i>deep system</i> to discover. A sword is melee, sure, but melee is just the beginning. The more you progress, the more you <i>tame the randomness</i>, making it easier to find the right tools for the job. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember, you\u2019ve gotta <i>earn</i> that stability. Climb the ranks, master your craft, and maybe, just maybe, you\u2019ll stop getting stuck with a stapler.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/73bf554ac543bdeb007affa91032a0bc.poster.avif?t=1755509312\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/73bf554ac543bdeb007affa91032a0bc.webm?t=1755509312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/73bf554ac543bdeb007affa91032a0bc.mp4?t=1755509312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AFFINITY SYSTEM / NETWORKING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>It\u2019s Not What You Know, It\u2019s Who You Know </strong></i><strong> </strong><br>In the gig world, <i>connections matter</i>. <br>Some NPCs will hook you up with <i>exclusive weapons</i>, <i>items</i>, or <i>mysterious things</i> (totally not stolen).\u00a0Others offer...\u00a0<i>unfortunate\u00a0</i>surprises, like bad encounters mid-run or losing something <i>really</i> important.<br>Build your network by taking on the right quests and backing the right people. But choose wisely,  a handshake today might be a stab in the back tomorrow.\u00a0<br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/b8bac33c521813160b2ba307dae40d15.avif?t=1755509312\" data-has-big width=800 height=537 /></span><i>We'll announce new characters on our Discord soon!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHAPE YOUR FREELANCER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Look However, Fight However</i></strong><br>Thanks to the <i>totally ethical</i> magic of the Soul Modder, your <i>appearance</i> is <i>your</i> choice. Wanna be a tiny, adorable assassin lugging around a gatling gun? Do it. A medieval tank blessed by the holy light but wielding\u2026 a rocket launcher? Go off.  <br>  <br>Your looks and abilities? Completely <i>separate</i>, <i>like they should be in real life, coff coff</i>. So shape-shift, mix it up, and create the Freelancer that truly represents <i>you</i> (or just the most cursed combination imaginable).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/6a61a5f0d4781d2ddd6cb39a198734da.poster.avif?t=1755509312\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/6a61a5f0d4781d2ddd6cb39a198734da.webm?t=1755509312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/6a61a5f0d4781d2ddd6cb39a198734da.mp4?t=1755509312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BIOME-CODED DUNGEONS </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Prep Hard, Pray Harder</i></strong><br>Every GigCrawler run drops you into <i>procedurally generated dungeons</i>, new <i>enemies</i>, and <i>loot</i> that depends on what\u2019s lurking in the shadows. Sounds fun, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But here\u2019s the kicker: your build is <i>locked in</i> before you even step foot inside. No mid-run Soul Modder swaps, no take-backs. You either prepare like a pro or end up as biome fertilizer. Choose wisely, adapt on the go, and maybe, just maybe, you won\u2019t be <i>that</i> Freelancer who brought a spoon to a mech fight.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/b8e5a3ed5bb061a494691ca1681f2bb0.poster.avif?t=1755509312\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/b8e5a3ed5bb061a494691ca1681f2bb0.webm?t=1755509312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/b8e5a3ed5bb061a494691ca1681f2bb0.mp4?t=1755509312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOCIALS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support us on <i>Kickstarter</i> and our socials! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563000/extras/624a3e6f67d8bec9a2fa5fd6d2624200.avif?t=1755509312\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
